1729:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         For ADC Slave, ADC is enabled only (conversion is not started).
1730:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         For ADC Master, ADC is enabled and multimode conversion is started.
1731:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @note   To guarantee a proper reset of all interruptions once all the needed
